Apple has asked some of its suppliers to cut production of iPhone 18 Pro components due to lower-than-expected demand, according to <em><a href="https://asia.nikkei.com/business/technology/exclusive-apple-cuts-iphone-18-pro-orders-due-to-soft-demand">Nikkei Asia</a></em> (&#36;). <br/>
<br/>
